{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-10_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-10","title":"不治の病","storyCode":"2-10","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-10_end.txt","sourceHash":"3a56b2f51617f87fa83870aa6d8c8ffa04e489a5ea8ef76dd39306c03122511e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"レユニオンは撤退していったが、その理由はWの任務成功の報だった。彼らの目的はロドスの足止めにあったのだ。\n一方、襲撃を受けたチェンのもとに訪れるはずの援軍は、たった一人で督察隊の足止めをこなす何者かによって阻まれていた。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十二关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"ぐ、っ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"はぁ、っはあ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"スカルシュレッダー！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"おい、大丈夫か！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、平気だ。……こいつら、実力はあるらしいな……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"動けそうならいいんだが……Wから連絡が来たんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"ターゲットは確保済み、向こうの仕事は済んだとよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……本当か？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ！　奇襲がうまくいったんだろうさ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"なあ、こうなったら俺たちも退くべきじゃないか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"まずは……タルラに、信号を送れ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"了解！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……撤退だ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"覚えてろよ、ロドスのクズどもめ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカルシュレッダー","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"次に会った時が、お前らの最期だ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――レユニオンが、退いていく……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"やたら手際いい退却ね。最初からこうするつもりだったのかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"まったく……あんな大口叩いといて、逃げ足だけは一級品ね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"この状況……どこか、変ですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"？　それは、どういう――"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"やはり、レユニオンの目的はロドスではないんだろうな。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"つまり、彼らはあくまで私たちを足止めしていただけ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ということは――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"狙われているのは、近衛局……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"みなさん、今すぐ支援に向かいましょう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"フランカさんは、周囲の偵察部隊にコンタクトを取ってください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それと、リスカムさん！　チェン隊長にも連絡を！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"なぜ援軍が来ないんだ！　督察隊の主力部隊はどうした！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"先ほど、レユニオンに足止めされていると連絡が……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"馬鹿な……！　あんな寄せ集めの連中に、足止めなどできるはずがないだろう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、それが……向こうは、たった一人とのことでして……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"――！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ep02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"まさか……！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["チェン"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局隊員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["フランカ"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["リスカム"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["スカルシュレッダー"]}]}
